# was: 匕伤群岛上也有恐怖的危机发生了吗？这真是让人感到困扰。如果有人相信目前到处流传的所有谣言，那么他们将会以为贾丹姆大陆已经陷入了全面的危机和混乱之中。我真希望我能够知道更多的消息。我本来都是倚靠我的车队提供相关的情报，但是这个月预计要到达的车队有很多都延迟了。而我所听到的消息让我感到十分的困扰。飓风、洪水，现在还有火山！我所听到最糟糕的消息是铁沙漠中央出现了一个滚烫的火湖，而且还有许多消息来源证实了这个消息。不知道在渡鸦海滨的这个水晶是否和这一切有关系。看起来这一切混乱同时出现并不单纯只是巧合。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:151 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:443
msgid "Disaster in Dagger Wound, too? This is indeed disturbing. If one were to believe all the rumors, one would think that all of Jadame is in upheaval and chaos.I wish I knew more. I rely on our caravan masters for news, but all who were supposed to arrive here this month have not. What I do hear, troubles me. Hurricanes, floods, and now a volcano! The worst I've heard is that a sea of fire has appeared in the Ironsand Desert--and this from many sources.I wonder if this crystal in Ravenshore has something to do with it. Its appearance at the onset of the calamity seems to be more than a coincidence."
msgstr "匕伤群岛上也有恐怖的危机发生了吗？这真是让人感到困扰。如果有人相信目前到处流传的所有谣言，那么他们将会以为贾丹姆大陆已经陷入了全面的危机和混乱之中。\n 我真希望我能够知道更多的消息。我本来都是倚靠我的车队提供相关的情报，但是这个月预计要到达的车队有很多都延迟了。而我所听到的消息让我感到十分的困扰。飓风、洪水，现在还有火山！我所听到最糟糕的消息是铁沙漠中央出现了一个滚烫的火湖，而且还有许多消息来源证实了这个消息。\n 不知道在渡鸦海滨的这个水晶是否和这一切有关系。看起来这一切混乱同时出现并不单纯只是巧合。"

# was: 瑞西在匕伤群岛的家中教授空气魔法的专家级技能。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:129 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1113 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4649
msgid "Reshie teaches the Expert skill of Air Magic from his home on the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr "瑞西在匕伤群岛的家中教授专家级空气魔法技能。"

# was: 这一切混乱的状况都对我们公会的运作造成了很大的影响。我需要更多的情报，但是目前却被谣言和绘声绘影的传说所掩盖了。许多人告诉我铁沙漠中央出现了一个火焰之湖。我听说了有关这个火湖的许多谣言，几乎让我相信了这个怪异的传说。如果你能够证明或是否定这个传说，对我将会有很大的意义。如果你愿意帮我一个忙，请去铁沙漠寻找这个火湖。如果火湖的确出现在沙漠中，请替我找到一个目击火湖出现的证人。把他带回这里来，让我可以亲自听听火湖的故事。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:152 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:466
msgid "All of this upheaval is seriously impacting our guild's business. I need more information, but I'm being buried in gossip and rumor.Many tell me of this sea of fire in the Ironsand Desert. I've heard the tale enough that I almost believe it. Confirmation or denial of the lake's existence would be of great help to me.If you would serve me, go to the Ironsand Desert and seek this lake. If it is indeed there, find me someone who saw it appear. Bring him back here so I can hear his story myself."
msgstr "这一切混乱的状况都对我们公会的运作造成了很大的影响。我需要更多的情报，但是目前却被谣言和绘声绘影的传说所掩盖了。\n 许多人告诉我铁沙漠中央出现了一个火焰之湖。我听说了有关这个火湖的许多谣言，几乎让我相信了这个怪异的传说。如果你能够证明或是否定这个传说，对我将会有很大的意义。\n 如果你愿意帮我一个忙，请去铁沙漠寻找这个火湖。如果火湖的确出现在沙漠中，请替我找到一个目击火湖出现的证人。把他带回这里来，让我可以亲自听听火湖的故事。"

# was: 奥斯崔恩·葛瑞维克是土系魔法的专家级导师，目前居住在匕伤群岛上的血滴镇中。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:135 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1134 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4679
msgid "Ostrin Grivic, Expert instructor of Earth Magic, lives in the village of Blood Drop on the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr "奥斯崔恩·葛瑞维克是土系魔法的专家级老师，目前居住在匕伤群岛上的血滴镇中。"

# was: 喔，你看你把事情弄成什么样子！当我要求你找个铁沙漠事件的目击证人时，我以为你会知道应该要把他好好的带回来！你看看这个可怜的家伙！赶快把他带到神庙去治疗。求求你……请你至少记得是在为公会服务，我们作事情有一定的水准。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1927 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:474
msgid "Oh, what a mess you've made of things! When I asked you to find me a witness of events in the Ironsand Desert, I thought it would be obvious that you'd have to return him to me in good condition! I mean look at the poor Troll! Take him to the temple and get him fixed up.And please...try to remember you're working for the guild. We do have a reputation for conducting ourselves with at least passing competence."
msgstr "喔，你看你把事情弄成什么样子！当我要求你找个铁沙漠事件的目击证人时，我以为你会知道应该要把他好好的带回来！你看看这个可怜的家伙！赶快把他带到神庙去治疗。\n 求求你……请你至少记得是在为公会服务，我们作事情有一定的水准。"

# was: 暗黑魔法大师卡拉·安伯普尔追随黑暗系大宗师希蒂库斯·暗影行者的足迹，如今与影塔的死灵法师们住在一起。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1169 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4759
msgid "Dark Magic Master Carla Umberpool followed the travels of Sithicus Shadowrunner, Grand Master of the Dark, and makes her home with the Necromancers of Shadowspire."
msgstr "暗黑魔法的大师卡拉·安伯普尔居住在影旋山脉附近的城市中。她和她的老师一样四处旅行，不过目前暂时定居下来，和死灵法师们切磋技巧。"

# was: 啊，原来这是真的。想像一下……一个火焰构成的大湖。但是我的目击证人在哪里？我必须要和亲眼目击火湖出现的证人谈谈。这很重要，原因我现在还没办法告诉你。替我找个真正看到火湖出现的证人！试着去巨魔的村庄——铁锈镇找找看吧！
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:154 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:477
msgid "Well, so it is true. Imagine…a lake of fire. But where is my eyewitness? I need to speak with someone who saw its formation. This is important…for reasons I'm unwilling to discuss with you now.Find me someone who saw the birth of the lake of fire! Try searching the Troll village, Rust."
msgstr "啊，原来这是真的。想像一下……一个火焰构成的大湖。但是我的目击证人在哪里？我必须要和亲眼目击火湖出现的证人谈谈。这很重要，原因我现在还没办法告诉你。\n 替我找个真正看到火湖出现的证人！试着去巨魔的村庄——铁锈镇找找看吧！"

# was: 我必须要知道铁沙漠中到底发生了什么事情，谣言我已经听得够多了。你必须要往东走几天的路，前往铁沙漠去彻底调查真正的状况。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:153 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:479
msgid "I must know more about what is going on in the Ironsand Desert. I can't use more rumors. I have enough of those already.I need you to actually go there. The desert is several days travel to the east."
msgstr "我必须要知道铁沙漠中到底发生了什么事情，谣言我已经听得够多了。\n 你必须要往东走几天的路，前往铁沙漠去彻底调查真正的状况。"

# was: 很好……至少你已经尽力了。你让另外三个势力加入了联盟，这是我们所需要的最低人手。这样我们才能满足“贾丹姆大陆必须要团结在一起……”的预言。真可惜你无法弄到更多的援军，但大灾变已经迫在眉睫，我们的动作得要快一点。你必须要前往渡鸦海滨和在该处聚会的联盟议会碰面。在那之后，你将必须和他们讨论如何面对元素界所带来的大危机。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1919 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:487 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:494
msgid "Very good…or at least, as good as can be expected. You managed to bring three partners into the alliance--the minimum number my advisors told me would be sufficient to fulfill the \"…Jadame, must stand together…\" part of the prophecy. A pity it could not be more, but events of the cataclysm are clearly coming to a head. It is time to move onward.You must travel to Ravenshore and meet with the alliance council gathered there. With them, decide what must be the next step we take in meeting the elemental crisis."
msgstr "很好……至少你已经尽力了。你让另外三个势力加入了联盟，这是我们所需要的最低人手。这样我们才能满足“贾丹姆大陆必须要团结在一起……”的预言。真可惜你无法弄到更多的援军，但大灾变已经迫在眉睫，我们的动作得要快一点。\n 你必须要前往渡鸦海滨和在该处聚会的联盟议会碰面。在那之后，你将必须和他们讨论如何面对元素界所带来的大危机。"

# was: 你必须要组织一个联盟，对抗我们眼前的末日威胁！你必须要去找寻太阳神庙、死灵法师公会、残破镇的牛头人、绞刑峡谷的龙、绞刑峡谷的猎龙人查尔斯·吉柯德。我知道你没办法让他们全部团结在一起，但是，你依旧必须要先尽力尝试才行。如果我们要逃过这一切危机，不让预言成真，我的智者告诉我至少要让前面所提到的势力中有三个同意加入这个联盟。如果你珍惜这个世界和自己的生命，赶快去完成这个任务吧！
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:155 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:490 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:497
msgid "You must form an alliance to stand against our threatened oblivion! Seek support from the Necromancers' Guild, Temple of the Sun, Minotaurs of Ravage Roaming, Dragons of Garrote Gorge, and the Dragon hunting party of Charles Quixote in Garrote Gorge. I'm sure that you will find it impossible to get all of them to agree to work together, but still, you must make your best effort.If we are to survive in this time of prophecy, my sages tell me that at least three of the groups I mentioned must agree to work together. Go and do this thing. If you value this world and your lives, go!"
msgstr "你必须要组织一个联盟，对抗我们眼前的末日威胁！你必须要去找寻太阳神庙、死灵法师公会、残破镇的牛头人、绞刑峡谷的龙、绞刑峡谷的猎龙人查尔斯·吉柯德。我知道你没办法让他们全部团结在一起，但是，你依旧必须要先尽力尝试才行。\n 如果我们要逃过这一切危机，不让预言成真，我的智者告诉我至少要让前面所提到的势力中有三个同意加入这个联盟。如果你珍惜这个世界和自己的生命，赶快去完成这个任务吧！"

# was: 你已经获胜了！
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1667 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4431 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12595
msgid "You have already won!"
msgstr "你已经赢了！"

# was: 你在这场游戏中失败了。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1663 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4427 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12602
msgid "You have failed the game!"
msgstr "你输掉了这场游戏！"

# was: 你完成了我原先认为是不可能的任务。虽然这些日子中，整个世界面对了许多的不确定性，但是你能够让关键的势力团结在一起面对末日，已经迈出了极大的一步。嗯，我已经完成了我的任务。我必须要将保护整个世界的工作交给联盟议会。我希望他们能够接受我在渡鸦海滨这里替他们所布置的会议室。毕竟这座屋子并不是我们最豪华的居所，但是，我希望议会能够靠近这个神秘的水晶。我希望他们，还有你们，都能够获得足够的好运！
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:156 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:529
msgid "You have done what I feared was impossible. Though these times are fraught with uncertainties, that you have united key factions of Jadame goes a long way towards securing our continued existence.Well, I have done what I can. I leave the defense of the land to the alliance council. I hope they find the accommodations I have provided them in Ravenshore to be adequate--the guild house there is not our most luxurious. Still, I though it would be best if the council was located near the crystal.I wish them, and you, good luck!"
msgstr "你完成了我原先认为是不可能的任务。虽然这些日子中，整个世界面对了许多的不确定性，但是你能够让关键的势力团结在一起面对末日，已经迈出了极大的一步。\n 嗯，我已经完成了我的任务。我必须要将保护整个世界的工作交给联盟议会。我希望他们能够接受我在渡鸦海滨这里替他们所布置的会议室。毕竟这座屋子并不是我们最豪华的居所，但是，我希望议会能够靠近这个神秘的水晶。\n 我希望他们，还有你们，都能够获得足够的好运！"

# was: 你在这场竞赛中失败了。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1664 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4428 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12693
msgid "You have failed the contest!"
msgstr "你在竞赛中落败了！"

# was: 是的，当火湖出现的时候，我就在那附近。一个怪异的传送门出现在村庄外面的沙漠中。你目前所看见的火焰就是从里面流　出来的。那些火焰看起来就像是水流泼在地面上一样地扩散。一波强烈的火焰盖过了我们的村庄，我大多数的同胞立刻就丧生了。现在这座村庄就是当时灾变之后仅剩的残骸。当这一切发生的时候，我正好在外面的山丘上观看这一切。这些怪异的状况我都目击了，但我实在很难相信这一切。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:157 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:533
msgid "Yes, I was here when the lake of fire first appeared. A strange gateway appeared on the desert plain outside the village. The fire you see spilled forth from it. The fire spread like water poured on the ground.A wave of flames rushed over the edge of the village. Most of my people were lost instantly. What remains of this village is as you see it.I was in the hills overlooking the village when this all happened. I saw it all, but I can hardly believe it."
msgstr "是的，当火湖出现的时候，我就在那附近。一个怪异的传送门出现在村庄外面的沙漠中。你目前所看见的火焰就是从里面流　出来的。那些火焰看起来就像是水流泼在地面上一样地扩散。\n 一波强烈的火焰盖过了我们的村庄，我大多数的同胞立刻就丧生了。现在这座村庄就是当时灾变之后仅剩的残骸。\n 当这一切发生的时候，我正好在外面的山丘上观看这一切。这些怪异的状况我都目击了，但我实在很难相信这一切。"

# was: 你在这场测试中失败了。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1665 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4429 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12784
msgid "You have failed the test!"
msgstr "你没能通过试炼！"

# was: 你在这场挑战中失败了。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1666 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4430 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12875
msgid "You have failed the challenge!"
msgstr "你没能通过挑战！"

# was: 如果不是因为我的父亲，我会愿意和你一起去的。他因为我的兄弟维尔拜而太过悲伤，没有办法照顾自己。我的父亲相信在维尔拜的尸骨安葬在村庄的墓穴中以前，他的灵魂没有办法安息。很不幸地，当火湖出现的时候，哥魔立刻就占据了我们的墓穴。来！这是我兄弟的骨灰。如果它们能够被安放在墓穴中，我相信我的父亲会好过一些。替我完成这个任务，我就愿意和你一起前往阿尔瓦。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:158 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:555
msgid "I would come with you, If it were not for my father. So deep is his mourning for my brother, Vilebite, that he cannot care for himself.My father believes that Vilebite's soul cannot rest until his remains are at rest in the village tomb. Unfortunately, Gogs infested the tomb when the lake of fire appeared.Here! Take my brother's ashes. I'm sure my father's grief will lessen if they are placed in the tomb. Do this for me and I will travel with you to Alvar."
msgstr "如果不是因为我的父亲，我会愿意和你一起去的。他因为我的兄弟维尔拜而太过悲伤，没有办法照顾自己。\n 我的父亲相信在维尔拜的尸骨安葬在村庄的墓穴中以前，他的灵魂没有办法安息。很不幸地，当火湖出现的时候，哥魔立刻就占据了我们的墓穴。\n 来！这是我兄弟的骨灰。如果它们能够被安放在墓穴中，我相信我的父亲会好过一些。替我完成这个任务，我就愿意和你一起前往阿尔瓦。"

# was: 你们刚刚说，“结盟，将贾丹姆大陆统一在一起。”如果不是卢德林提议这件事情，我早就把你宰了当早餐。虽然这个点子很有趣，但是我现在没有空闲考虑这个建议。我们每天都受到查尔斯·吉柯德旗下的骑士攻击。如果他们不再骚扰我们，我就可以考虑卢德林的建议。也许你们可以帮我料理吉柯德？
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:201 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:568
msgid "\"An alliance to unite Jadame,\" you say. If it wasn't Lordrin who was proposing it, I would normally have slain you for my supper.While intriguing, I cannot consider the idea now. We are under daily attack by the accursed knights of Charles Quixote. If he were not a problem, I could do as Lordrin asks.Perhaps you could help me with Quixote?"
msgstr "你们刚刚说，“结盟，将贾丹姆大陆统一在一起。”如果不是卢德林提议这件事情，我早就把你宰了当早餐。\n 虽然这个点子很有趣，但是我现在没有空闲考虑这个建议。我们每天都受到查尔斯·吉柯德旗下的骑士攻击。如果他们不再骚扰我们，我就可以考虑卢德林的建议。\n 也许你们可以帮我料理吉柯德？"

# was: 赏金猎人行会
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/house_animations.txt:524 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/house_animations.txt:896 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/house_data.txt:525
msgid "Guild of Bounty Hunters"
msgstr "赏金猎人公会"

# was: 他们就如同光明与黑暗两个光谱上的极端一样，死灵法师公会和太阳神庙之间的关系一直都不好，但现在是他们公开宣战的时段。奥斯卡·提尔宣称他看见了不寻常的启示，督促他将这股污染贾丹姆大陆的力量从世界上彻底消除。两群人都不是在我们的大陆上土生土长的。公会基地在影旋山脉区域，第一个，也是唯一的太阳神庙则是在低语之森。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1752 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5918
msgid "Lying as they do on opposite ends of the Light to Dark spectrum, relationships between the Necromancers' Guild and the Temple of the Sun have never been the best, but now they battle openly. Oskar Tyre, head priest of the Temple says a holy vision drove him to declare war on the guild so as to rid Jadame of the taint of darkness.Both groups are relative newcomers to our continent. The guild has set up its foothold in Shadowspire, and the First (and only) Sun Temple of Jadame is in Murmurwoods."
msgstr "他们就如同光明与黑暗两个光谱上的极端一样，死灵法师公会和太阳神庙之间的关系一直都不好，但现在是他们公开宣战的时段。奥斯卡·提尔宣称他看见了不寻常的启示，督促他将这股污染贾丹姆大陆的力量从世界上彻底消除。\n 两群人都不是在我们的大陆上土生土长的。公会基地在影旋山脉区域，第一个，也是唯一的太阳神庙则是在低语之森。"

# was: 既然现在我已不需要担心我们下一代的生命安危了，我就准备去找吉柯德复仇。他的营地将会面临我们利爪和火焰的攻击。原先狩猎我们的骑士将会变成我们的猎物。至于你所提到的联盟……你们帮了我很大的忙，我会遵守约定。只要我把敌人都处理掉了，我就会前往渡鸦海滨加入议会的阵容。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1892 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:594
msgid "Now that I need not fear my heir's destruction. I will visit my revenge on Quixote. His camp will face the assault of fire and claw. Those who have hunted us are now our prey animals.As for your alliance…you have done me a great service. I will honor my debt. As soon as I've set my enemies to flight or the beyond, I will join the alliance council in Ravenshore."
msgstr "既然现在我已不需要担心我们下一代的生命安危了，我就准备去找吉柯德复仇。他的营地将会面临我们利爪和火焰的攻击。原先狩猎我们的骑士将会变成我们的猎物。\n 至于你所提到的联盟……你们帮了我很大的忙，我会遵守约定。只要我把敌人都处理掉了，我就会前往渡鸦海滨加入议会的阵容。"

# was: 上个月吉柯德派了一小群人入侵我们的洞穴。他们杀死了很多龙，并且夺走了我们那些还没孵化的龙蛋。只要这些死家伙还挟持龙蛋，我们就不能够攻击他们的营地。如果你们能够将龙蛋归还给我们，我就可以直接了当地杀死吉柯德。只要你替我完成这个任务，我就加入你的联盟。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:202 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:615
msgid "Last month one of Quixote's raiding parties invaded our caves. They slew many and took with them the egg containing my unborn heir. While those foul slayers hold the egg, we cannot attack their encampment.If you were to return the egg to me, I could destroy Quixote. Do this for me and I will join your alliance."
msgstr "上个月吉柯德派了一小群人入侵我们的洞穴。他们杀死了很多龙，并且夺走了我们那些还没孵化的龙蛋。只要这些死家伙还挟持龙蛋，我们就不能够攻击他们的营地。\n 如果你们能够将龙蛋归还给我们，我就可以直接了当地杀死吉柯德。只要你替我完成这个任务，我就加入你的联盟。"

# was: 太好了！把所有的奶酪给我！我一定要吃吃看！啊……嚼嚼……独角兽奶酪，味道太精致了……嗯嗯，艾顿布理，烟熏味相当的不错……登达克……味道就不怎么好了，对吧？你帮我完成了贾丹姆大陆的奶酪品尝之旅！我死也甘愿了！我太感激你了！这是我答应给你的报酬！
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1794 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6151
msgid "Excellent! Give me the cheeses! I must consume them!Ah….munch munch….frelandeau, exquisite….mmmm, and eldenbrie, wondrously smoky…and hmmm, dunduck…well, that's not very nice, is it?You have made my Jadamean cheese cataloging safari a success! I can die a happy man! You have the humble thanks of a man of cheese. And here is your promised reward!"
msgstr "太好了！把所有的奶酪给我！我一定要吃吃看！\n 啊……嚼嚼……独角兽奶酪，味道太精致了……嗯嗯，艾顿布理，烟熏味相当的不错……登达克……味道就不怎么好了，对吧？\n 你帮我完成了贾丹姆大陆的奶酪品尝之旅！我死也甘愿了！我太感激你了！这是我答应给你的报酬！"

# was: 时光库
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:676 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6263
msgid "Vault of Time"
msgstr "时间宝库"

# was: 你知道吗，据说时光宝库在渡鸦海滨建成之前就已经存在；这座城镇是围绕着它修建的。据说里面存放着数百年前统治这片土地的索恩皇帝的宝藏。许多人前来试图打开宝库，但谁也没有成功。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1861 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6264
msgid "You know, it is said the Vault of Time was here before Ravenshore; the town was built around it. It is supposed to contain the treasure of the old Emperor Thorn who ruled the lands around here hundreds of years ago. Many come here to try and open the vault, but none succeed."
msgstr "你知道吗？据说时光金库在渡鸦海滨创建之前就存在了，这座城镇根本就是绕着该金库所创建的。金库里面应该藏着索恩帝王的财富。许多人来到这个地方想要开启该金库，但是都失败了。"

# was: 地元素界
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/map_stats.txt:13 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:685 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6299
msgid "Plane of Earth"
msgstr "大地位面"

# was: 冒险
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/house_animations.txt:500 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/house_data.txt:501 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:692
msgid "Adventure"
msgstr "探险号"

# was: 吸血鬼墓窖
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/map_stats.txt:35 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:717 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6514
msgid "Vampire Crypt"
msgstr "吸血鬼墓穴"

# was: 暗示
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:1363 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:736 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:892
msgid "Hint"
msgstr "提示"

# was: 我不需要我的预知能力，就可以知道你接下来该做什么。照着费尔蒙要求的去作，去找巴斯沈·卢德林，也就是阿尔瓦商人公会的会长。他目前人在阿尔瓦中。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:237 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1938 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6603
msgid "I don't need my vision to tell me what you must do next. Do as Fellmoon asked of you. Go seek Bastian Loudrin, the guildmaster of the Alvarian Merchant Guild. He is in the city of Alvar."
msgstr "我不需要我的预知能力就能够知道你接下来该作些什么。照着费尔蒙要求的去作，去找巴斯沈·卢德林，也就是阿尔瓦商人公会的会长。他目前人在阿尔瓦中。"

# was: 很明显的，你必须要将巨魔欧瓦都带到阿尔瓦的商人公会去。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:240 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1941 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6609
msgid "It is clear to me that you must bring the Troll, Overdune, to the merchant guild in Alvar."
msgstr "很明显你必须要将巨魔欧瓦都带到阿尔瓦的商人公会去。"

# was: 在宇宙万物的平衡之间出了问题，我花了好长一段时间才知道了原因。在绞刑峡谷中的骑士和飞龙之间出现了冲突。你必须要选择一方来协助，阻止这场战争。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:243 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1944 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6694
msgid "There is great turmoil in the Balance. It has taken me some time to know its source, but I know it now. There is conflict between the Dragons and Knights who fight in Garrote Gorge. It is your destiny to ally with one of the two at the expense of the other."
msgstr "在宇宙万物的平衡之中存在着巨大的动荡，我花了一些时间才知道了原因。绞刑峡谷中的骑士和飞龙之间出现了冲突。你必须要选择一方，协助他们，平息这场战争。"

# was: 在宇宙万物的平衡之间出了问题，我花了好长一段时间才知道了原因。这是由于低语之森的太阳神庙的牧师，以及影旋山脉的死灵法师之间的战争。你必须要选择一方来协助，阻止这场战争。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:242 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1943 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6711
msgid "There is great turmoil in the Balance. It has taken me some time to know its source, but I know it now. It is caused by the war between the clerics of the Temple of the Sun located in Murmurwoods, and the Necromancers' Guild of Shadowspire. It is your destiny to undo the turmoil by choosing one of these two to ally with."
msgstr "在宇宙万物的平衡之中存在着巨大的动荡，我花了一些时间才知道了原因。这是由低语之森的太阳神庙的牧师，以及影旋山脉的死灵法师之间的战争造成的。你必须要选择一方，协助他们，平息这场战争。"

# was: 我今天看穿了非常远的距离，但是在时间方面则没有什么斩获。我看见了巴尔萨煞巢穴的牛头人们遭遇到了极大的灾祸，我感应到你的命运和他们的命运是相关连的，你必须要将它们从危难中救出来。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:241 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1942 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6715
msgid "I see far through space today, but not through time. A great disaster has befallen the Minotaurs of Balthazar Lair in Ravage Roaming. I feel that your destiny is linked with their fate. You must rescue them from their peril."
msgstr "我能够穿透空间看得很远，但无法穿透时间。我看见了巴尔萨煞巢穴的牛头人们遭遇了巨大的灾难，我感应到你和他们的命运是相关连的，你必须要将他们从危难中拯救出来。"

# was: 在我昨天晚上的梦中，我看见你在铁沙漠中旅行，寻找目击大灾变期间火湖形成的目击证人。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:239 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1940 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6720
msgid "In my dreams last night, I saw you traveling to the Ironsand Desert to find a witness to the formation of a great lake of fire which formed there during the cataclysm."
msgstr "我昨天晚上做了个梦，梦里面我看见你在铁沙漠中旅行，寻找大灾变期间目击火湖形成的证人。"

# was: 我看见了在你的现在和未来之间有一个很重要的连接还没有完成。你必须要回去见巴斯沈·卢德林，继续和他的对话。他将会告诉你下一步应该要怎么做。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:238 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1939 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6723
msgid "I see an important connection has not been made between the present and your future. You must return to Bastian Loudrin and continue your conversations with him. He will send you on the next step down your road."
msgstr "我看见了在你的现在和未来之间有一个很重要的连接还没有完成。你必须回去找巴斯沈·卢德林，继续和他的谈话。他将会告诉你下一步应该要怎么做。"

# was: 你是受雇于阿尔瓦的商人，对吧？是的，我想你应该和达德洛斯，也就是你商队的头子谈谈。我的天眼通告诉我他就在匕伤群岛上。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:234 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1935 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6731
msgid "You are employed by the Merchants of Alvar, yes? Well, I think you should speak with Dadeross, the leader of your caravan. My far seeing vision tells me he is on the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr "你是受雇于阿尔瓦的商人吗？那么我想你应该和达德洛斯谈谈。我的天眼通告诉我他就在匕伤群岛上。"

# was: 啊，是的……传送门。我研究它们和建造它们的神秘文化好多年了。他们是在蜥蜴人来到这里之前许多旧有的文明之下所建造的。他们是用来在不同的岛屿之间传送用的工具。很遗憾的，能够启动这些传送门的能源之石目前数量非常的稀少。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:36 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:69
msgid "Ah yes…\"the portals.\" I have been studying them and the lost culture that built them for years.They were built by the civilization that had its day long before the Lizardmen came to inhabit these islands. They were a means of instantaneous travel between the islands. Sadly, the power stones needed to operate them are in short supply."
msgstr "啊，是的……传送门。我研究它们和建造它们的神秘文化好多年了。\n 他们是在蜥蜴人来到这里之前许多旧有的文明之下所建造的。他们是用来在不同的岛屿之间传送用的工具。很遗憾的，能够启动这些传送门的能源之石目前数量非常的稀少。"

# was: 连100个金币也没有，我可不能卖给你们，毕竟我要靠它吃饭啊！
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2069 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7304
msgid "I really can't go any less than 100 gold; I need to make a living, too."
msgstr "连100 个金币也没有，我可不能卖给你们，毕竟我要靠它吃饭啊！"

# was: 注意了，谁能告诉我有关失踪的参赛者们的消息，我会奖赏1000个金币。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2144 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7517
msgid "Keep in mind I have a 1000 gold reward for the group to bring back information on the contestants that have disappeared."
msgstr "注意了，谁能告诉我有关失踪的参赛者们的消息，我会奖赏1000 个金币。"

# was: 精神振奋（耐力暂时+50）
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2212 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7656
msgid "Refreshing! (+50 Endurance temporary)"
msgstr "神清气爽！（耐力 +50，临时）"

# was: 嗯嗯……如果卢德林这个奸商都开始关切他的财富之外的事情，事态一定变得非常严重……我也必须承认，空气中也似乎有着末日即将到来的味道。如果在一般的状况下，我很愿意加入这个联盟，只为了维持我和卢德林之间的良好关系。很遗憾的，我目前手上的资源都被困住了，没有办法抽出多馀的资源来协助他处理这个所谓的联盟。或者我们可以彼此帮一把？如果你能够帮我个小忙，我可以考虑接受你的建议。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:240 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:868
msgid "Hmmm…things must be serious if trader Loudrin is involving himself in matters other than his own fortunes...and I must say that there is a taint of doom in the air.If only for continued good business between my operation and his, I would normally entertain this notion of Loudrin's. Unfortunately, matters here are tying up all of my resources. I have none to spare for support of this alliance you speak of.Say, perhaps we can help each other? If you were to take care of a little matter for me, I could consider honoring your request."
msgstr "嗯嗯……如果卢德林这个奸商都开始关切他的财富之外的事情，事态一定变得非常严重……我也必须承认，空气中也似乎有着末日即将到来的味道。\n 如果在一般的状况下，我很愿意加入这个联盟，只为了维持我和卢德林之间的良好关系。很遗憾的，我目前手上的资源都被困住了，没有办法抽出多馀的资源来协助他处理这个所谓的联盟。\n 或者我们可以彼此帮一把？如果你能够帮我个小忙，我可以考虑接受你的建议。"

# was: 你为组装做好了躯干的准备。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2883 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8828
msgid "You prepare the torso for assembly with the rest of the parts."
msgstr "你们找到人偶的身体躯干了。"

# was: 你为组装做好了左腿的准备。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2884 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8840
msgid "You prepare the left leg for assembly with the rest of the parts."
msgstr "你们找到人偶的左腿了。"

# was: 你为组装做好了右腿的准备。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2885 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8849
msgid "You prepare the right leg for assembly with the rest of the parts."
msgstr "你们找到人偶的右腿了。"

# was: 你为组装做好了左臂的准备。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2886 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8861
msgid "You prepare the left arm for assembly with the rest of the parts."
msgstr "你们找到人偶的左臂了。"

# was: 你为组装做好了右臂的准备。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2887 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8873
msgid "You prepare the right arm for assembly with the rest of the parts."
msgstr "你们找到人偶的右臂了。"

# was: 你为组装做好了头部的准备。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2888 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8888
msgid "You prepare the head for assembly with the rest of the parts."
msgstr "你们找到人偶的头部了。"

# was: 你从索格在残破镇的要塞拿回了龙蛋吗？喔，别开口，我从你挫败的表情中看得出来你又失败了。我很坚持原先的提议。你不把龙蛋带来，我就不会加入你的联盟。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:242 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:890
msgid "Have you recovered the Dragon egg from Zog's Ravage Roaming fortress? Oh, never mind. I can see from your abashed expression that you have not.I stand firm on our deal. Bring me that egg, or I'll have nothing to do with your alliance!"
msgstr "你从索格在残破镇的要塞拿回了龙蛋吗？喔，别开口，我从你挫败的表情中看得出来你又失败了。\n 我很坚持原先的提议。你不把龙蛋带来，我就不会加入你的联盟。"

# was: 你为组装做好了头部（上面有一处凹痕）的准备。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2889 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8903
msgid "You prepare the head (with a dent in it) for assembly with the rest of the parts."
msgstr "你们找到人偶的（扭曲的）头部了。"

# was: 好的，就这么说定了。我会赶快做好安排，亲自前往渡鸦海滨的议会。说实话，我自己也想换换环境。我会让副手来接管我的工作。最后，我必须对你再一次说：干得好。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1885 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:894
msgid "Well, that matter's done. I will make arrangements to travel to Ravenshore so I myself may sit on your council. Frankly, I could use a bit of change. I will leave my second in command, Reginald Dorray, in charge.Again, good job."
msgstr "好的，就这么说定了。我会赶快做好安排，亲自前往渡鸦海滨的议会。说实话，我自己也想换换环境。我会让副手来接管我的工作。\n 最后，我必须对你再一次说：干得好。"

# was: 你还没有任何可以组装的部件。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2890 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8950
msgid "You have no parts to assemble yet."
msgstr "你们还没有找到所有的人偶部位。"

# was: 你取下正常的头部，换上了带凹痕的头部。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2893 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8980
msgid "You remove the normal head and replace it with the dented head."
msgstr "你们把人偶那个表情正常的头部拆下来，换上这个表情扭曲的。"

# was: 你取下带凹痕的头部，换上了正常的头部。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2894 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8990
msgid "You remove the dented head and replace it with the normal head."
msgstr "你们把人偶那个表情扭曲的头部拆下来，换上这个表情正常的。"

# was: 我的一名顾客，有个很有魅力的称号——食人妖“豺狼索格”，它背弃了我的信任。我给了他一个很有价值的物品，他也答应未来会付尾款，但是这尾款再也没有出现过。我派了一名信差去要求归还这个物品，龙蛋是个非常稀少的宝物！但这个信差竟然被杀害了。不用说，这件事情让我很困扰，我花费了很多的人力和金钱想要复仇。如果，你能够从索格在残破镇的要塞中替我找回龙蛋，我将会很高兴加入你的联盟。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:241 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:916
msgid "One of my customers, an Ogre that goes by the charming moniker of \"Zog the Jackal,\" has seriously betrayed my trust. I gave him an item of great value on promise of future payment. This rather large payment never arrived. I sent a messenger to demand return of the item--a Dragon's egg of great potential. This messenger was slain!Needless to say, this matter concerns me greatly. I have allotted both money and men for the purpose of revenge. If, however, you were to recover the egg for me from Zog's fortress in Ravage Roaming, I would be glad to pledge service to your alliance."
msgstr "我的一名顾客，有个很有魅力的称号——食人妖“豺狼索格”，它背弃了我的信任。我给了他一个很有价值的物品，他也答应未来会付尾款，但是这尾款再也没有出现过。我派了一名信差去要求归还这个物品，龙蛋是个非常稀少的宝物！但这个信差竟然被杀害了。\n 不用说，这件事情让我很困扰，我花费了很多的人力和金钱想要复仇。如果，你能够从索格在残破镇的要塞中替我找回龙蛋，我将会很高兴加入你的联盟。"

# was: 你想要我的同胞加入你的联盟吗？我怎么可能拒绝你？你不只让我们逃出了死亡的命运，联盟所对抗的灾难还让我们受到了重大的损失！我们都听从你的命令。我自己将会全速赶到渡鸦海滨，加入联盟议会的行列中。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:247 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:922
msgid "You would like my herd to join into an alliance? How could I refuse you? Not only have you saved us from certain death, we have suffered directly from the cataclysm the alliance is being created to fight!You have my pledge. With the greatest haste I myself will travel to Ravenshore to take a seat on the alliance council."
msgstr "你想要我的同胞加入你的联盟吗？我怎么可能拒绝你？你不只让我们逃出了死亡的命运，联盟所对抗的灾难还让我们受到了重大的损失！\n 我们都听从你的命令。我自己将会全速赶到渡鸦海滨，加入联盟议会的行列中。"

# was: 巴尔萨煞巢穴拥有很多不同的高度，有其它的洞穴和这个洞穴一样高，所以可能有很多其它人都活了下来。有关于这次的事件，我想了很久。虽然有很多隧道都已经淹入水中，但是你还是可以利用门和通气管道当做排水的通道。事实上，整个巢穴中的积水可以通过打开底层的逃生管道而把水排干。救救我的同胞！你将会赢得他们永恒的敬意！
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:249 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:943
msgid "Balthazar Lair has many levels. There are other chambers as high as this one., so there may be others who have survived.I have thought long on this. Though many of the tunnels are flooded, it may be possible to drain them using the doors and air vents as valves. In fact, the whole lair could be drained through the lower level escape tunnel. Help my herd! You would have our eternal gratitude."
msgstr "巴尔萨煞巢穴拥有很多不同的高度，有其它的洞穴和这个洞穴一样高，所以可能有很多其它人都活了下来。\n 有关于这次的事件，我想了很久。虽然有很多隧道都已经淹入水中，但是你还是可以利用门和通气管道当做排水的通道。事实上，整个巢穴中的积水可以通过打开底层的逃生管道而把水排干。救救我的同胞！你将会赢得他们永恒的敬意！"

# was: 废弃神殿
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/house_animations.txt:347 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/house_animations.txt:423 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/house_data.txt:348
msgid "Abandoned Temple"
msgstr "废庙"

# was: 建造传送门的失落文明所盖的神庙废墟就在主岛屿西北方的地方。不过，因为里面有很多危险的爬虫类，所以其实我并没有探索过里面到底有什么东西。不过，我倒是怀疑庙里面可能有个水下隧道，通往西北方岛上的那座港口。在桥梁都被摧毁之后，那座隧道也许成为了唯一抵达港口或是船只的路径！
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:40 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:99
msgid "The ruins of a temple built by the lost civilization lies on the island just northwest of the main island. I have not explored it however, for dangerous reptiles have made it their lair. I do suspect that the temple leads to an underwater tunnel which surfaces near the boat docks on the northwest island.With the bridges out, that tunnel may be the only way to reach the docks and a boat to safety!"
msgstr "建造传送门的失落文明所盖的神庙废墟就在主岛屿西北方的地方。不过，因为里面有很多危险的爬虫类，所以其实我并没有探索过里面到底有什么东西。不过，我倒是怀疑庙里面可能有个水下隧道，通往西北方岛上的那座港口。\n 在桥梁都被摧毁之后，那座隧道也许成为了唯一抵达港口或是船只的路径！"

